<title>USA: Granite Construction wins contract.</title>
<headline>Granite Construction wins contract.</headline>
<dateline>WATSONVILLE, Calif. 1997-02-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Granite Construction Inc on Tuesday said it has won a $16.8 million contract from the Arizona Department of Transportation for various improvements to U.S. Highway 93.</p>
<p>Work is set to begin in March and take about 16 months to complete, Granite said in a statement.</p>
